# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid leaking host build artefacts
# into the image.
.git
.github
**/build/
**/install/
**/Validation/
**/validation.log
external_distributions/build
external_distributions/install
**/CMakeUserPresets.json
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/__pycache__/
.oomph-build-cache
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
